=begin pod
=TITLE Usage

=head1 Quick Start

=for code
zef install PDF::Lite JSON::Fast
export CHECKWRITER_ASSETS=$PWD
raku bin/make-fidelity-check.raku
raku bin/make-hancock-check.raku

=head1 Output

* output/fidelity-sample.pdf
* output/hancock-sample.pdf

=head1 Tweaks

Adjust coordinates in the bank JSON and re-run the CLI. Common nudges:

* positions.payee_line (x, y, w)
* positions.amount_box (x, y, w, h)
* positions.legal_line, positions.memo_line, positions.signature_line
* positions.micr.baseline_from_bottom
=end pod
